msgstr "請使用以下指令安裝："

msgid "Install the GStreamer plugins base, bad and libav from your distribution."
msgstr "請從您的發行版安裝 GStreamer 外掛程式 base、bad 和 libav。"

msgid "GStreamer plugins are missing"
msgstr "缺少 GStreamer 外掛程式"

msgid "At start"
msgstr "啟動時"

msgid "Channel at start"
msgstr "啟動時的頻道"

msgid "Last channel watched"
msgstr "最後觀看的頻道"

msgid "First channel of the current list"
msgstr "目前清單的第一個頻道"

msgid "A chosen channel"
msgstr "指定的頻道"

msgid "The current list is the channel list as you left it: TV or radio, filter, group and sort order."
msgstr "目前清單是指您離開時的頻道清單：電視或廣播、篩選、群組和排序方式。"

msgid "Channel list"
msgstr "頻道清單"

msgid "All channels or one of your favourites lists."
msgstr "所有頻道或您的其中一份最愛清單。"

msgid "Tuned at every start, whichever channel you watched last."
msgstr "每次啟動時調諧，不論您上次觀看哪個頻道。"

msgid "No channel (black screen)"
msgstr "無頻道（黑畫面）"

msgid "Lock"
msgstr "鎖定"

msgid "Search this satellite"
msgstr "搜尋此衛星"

msgid "Tick the satellites to search."
msgstr "請勾選要搜尋的衛星。"

msgid "Horizontal"
msgstr "水平"

msgid "Vertical"
msgstr "垂直"

msgid "Left (circular)"
msgstr "左旋（圓極化）"

msgid "Right (circular)"
msgstr "右旋（圓極化）"

msgid "Auto"
msgstr "自動"

msgid "Add…"
msgstr "新增…"

msgid "Tick all"
msgstr "全部勾選"

msgid "Tick none"
msgstr "全部取消勾選"

msgid "Back to the lists"
msgstr "返回清單"

msgid "Forget the changes to this position and use the transponder lists again"
msgstr "放棄對此位置的變更，並重新使用轉頻器清單"

msgid "The changed list is kept for this position."
msgstr "變更後的清單會保留給此位置。"

msgid "This transponder is already in the list."
msgstr "此轉頻器已在清單中。"

msgid "Tick the transponders to search."
msgstr "請勾選要搜尋的轉頻器。"

msgid "DVB-S only uses QPSK; choose DVB-S2 for 8PSK, 16APSK and 32APSK."
msgstr "DVB-S 只使用 QPSK；8PSK、16APSK 和 32APSK 請選擇 DVB-S2。"

msgid "This transponder is not valid."
msgstr "此轉頻器無效。"

msgid "All {n} transponders are searched."
msgstr "將搜尋全部 {n} 個轉頻器。"

msgid "{on} of {n} transponders are searched. A search of single transponders does not add the ones the network announces (NIT)."
msgstr "將搜尋 {on} / {n} 個轉頻器。搜尋個別轉頻器時不會加入網路宣告的轉頻器 (NIT)。"

msgid "Edit transponder"
msgstr "編輯轉頻器"

msgid "Add transponder"
msgstr "新增轉頻器"

msgid "Transponders of {position}"
msgstr "{position} 的轉頻器"

msgid "The list could not be saved."
msgstr "無法儲存清單。"

msgid "Transponders: search single ones, add, change or remove them"
msgstr "轉頻器：搜尋個別轉頻器，或新增、變更、移除"

msgid "{n} transponders; where only some are ticked, just those are searched."
msgstr "{n} 個轉頻器；若只勾選部分，則只搜尋這些。"

msgid "Own transponder list: {positions}."
msgstr "自有轉頻器清單：{positions}。"

msgid "The stream format the server delivers. Choose HLS when the channels do not play as MPEG-TS."
msgstr "伺服器提供的串流格式。若頻道無法以 MPEG-TS 播放，請選擇 HLS。"

msgid "Give the list its own name (also the name of its channel group)"
msgstr "為清單自訂名稱（也是其頻道群組的名稱）"

msgid "List renamed to {name}"
msgstr "清單已重新命名為 {name}"

msgid "Add Channels…"
msgstr "新增頻道…"

msgid "Add channels"
msgstr "新增頻道"

msgid "Tune a single frequency by hand and compare its channels with the channel list: add new ones, update changed ones, remove old ones."
msgstr "手動調諧單一頻率，並將其頻道與頻道清單比較：新增新頻道、更新已變更頻道、移除舊頻道。"

msgid "Unchanged"
msgstr "未變更"

msgid "Changed"
msgstr "已變更"

msgid "No longer broadcast"
msgstr "已停播"

msgid "Bandwidth"
msgstr "頻寬"

msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

msgid "Add Channels"
msgstr "新增頻道"

msgid "Tune Channel"
msgstr "調諧頻道"

msgid "No tuner found."
msgstr "找不到調諧器。"

msgid "Log"
msgstr "記錄"

msgid "The PLP of a DVB-T2 multiplex that sends several; -1 leaves the choice to the tuner"
msgstr "傳送多個 PLP 的 DVB-T2 多工中的 PLP；-1 表示由調諧器選擇"

msgid "Enter by hand"
msgstr "手動輸入"

msgid "Tuning…"
msgstr "正在調諧…"

msgid "The tuner could not be used."
msgstr "無法使用該調諧器。"

msgid "No channels found on this frequency."
msgstr "此頻率上找不到頻道。"

msgid "{same} unchanged, {changed} changed, {new} new, {gone} no longer broadcast."
msgstr "{same} 個未變更，{changed} 個已變更，{new} 個新頻道，{gone} 個已停播。"

msgid "Saved: {added} added, {updated} updated, {removed} removed."
msgstr "已儲存：新增 {added} 個，更新 {updated} 個，移除 {removed} 個。"

msgid "Satellite · DiSEqC port {n}"
msgstr "衛星 · DiSEqC 連接埠 {n}"

msgid "Source: satellite, cable, terrestrial or internet streams, a DiSEqC port, or a satellite, network, import file or IPTV list"
msgstr "來源：衛星、有線、地面或網路串流、DiSEqC 連接埠，或衛星、網路、匯入檔案或 IPTV 清單"

msgid "LinDVB channel file (.json): everything, with the favourites lists"
msgstr "LinDVB 頻道檔 (.json)：全部內容，含最愛清單"

msgid "M3U playlist (.m3u): internet channels and DVB-I streams"
msgstr "M3U 播放清單 (.m3u)：網路頻道和 DVB-I 串流"

msgid "dvbv5 channel file (.conf): tuner channels"
msgstr "dvbv5 頻道檔 (.conf)：調諧器頻道"

msgid "CSV table (.csv): every channel"
msgstr "CSV 表格 (.csv)：所有頻道"

msgid "Export Channel List"
msgstr "匯出頻道清單"

msgid "TV channels only"
msgstr "僅電視頻道"

msgid "Radio stations only"
msgstr "僅廣播電台"

msgid "The channels shown in the list ({n})"
msgstr "清單中顯示的頻道 ({n})"

msgid "Save…"
msgstr "儲存…"

msgid "There are no channels to export."
msgstr "沒有可匯出的頻道。"

msgid "None of these {total} channels can be stored in this format; internet channels go into M3U, tuner channels into dvbv5, every channel into CSV or the LinDVB channel file."
msgstr "這 {total} 個頻道都無法以此格式儲存；網路頻道可存為 M3U，調諧器頻道可存為 dvbv5，所有頻道可存為 CSV 或 LinDVB 頻道檔。"

msgid "{n} of {total} channels will be saved; the other {skipped} cannot be stored in this format."
msgstr "將儲存 {n} / {total} 個頻道；其餘 {skipped} 個無法以此格式儲存。"

msgid "{n} channels will be saved."
msgstr "將儲存 {n} 個頻道。"

msgid "Could not save {name}"
msgstr "無法儲存 {name}"

msgid "{n} channels exported to {path}"
msgstr "已將 {n} 個頻道匯出至 {path}"

msgid "Import channel list (LinDVB .json, dvbv5, VDR, lamedb, M3U, CSV, DVBViewer .ini)"
msgstr "匯入頻道清單（LinDVB .json、dvbv5、VDR、lamedb、M3U、CSV、DVBViewer .ini）"

msgid "Server (host:9981)"
msgstr "伺服器 (host:9981)"

msgid "The channels of a Tvheadend server, with its channel tags as groups and its programme guide. Leave user name and password empty when the server does not ask for them. The password is kept in the LinDVB settings."
msgstr "Tvheadend 伺服器的頻道，以其頻道標籤作為群組，並含其節目表。若伺服器不要求，使用者名稱和密碼請留空。密碼保存在 LinDVB 設定中。"

msgid "Tvheadend: {n} programmes loaded"
msgstr "Tvheadend：已載入 {n} 個節目"

msgid "Hardware Tuners"
msgstr "硬體調諧器"

msgid "No hardware tuner found."
msgstr "找不到硬體調諧器。"

msgid "The Snap package may only use the tuners once its DVB interface is connected: run “sudo snap connect lindvb:dvb” and start LinDVB again."
msgstr "Snap 套件只有在其 DVB 介面連接後才能使用調諧器：請執行「sudo snap connect lindvb:dvb」並重新啟動 LinDVB。"

msgid "Linux has not set up a DVB device (/dev/dvb is missing). The driver or the firmware of the tuner is probably missing; “dmesg | grep -i dvb” shows what the kernel reports."
msgstr "Linux 尚未設定 DVB 裝置（缺少 /dev/dvb）。可能缺少調諧器的驅動程式或韌體；「dmesg | grep -i dvb」會顯示核心的回報內容。"

msgid "Connect a tuner and open the preferences again."
msgstr "請連接調諧器並重新開啟偏好設定。"

msgid "{n} tuners found in this computer."
msgstr "在此電腦中找到 {n} 個調諧器。"

msgid "1 tuner found in this computer."
msgstr "在此電腦中找到 1 個調諧器。"

msgid "Tuner {n}: {name}"
msgstr "調諧器 {n}：{name}"

msgid "Internet stream {host}"
msgstr "網路串流 {host}"

msgid "the server ended the stream"
msgstr "伺服器已結束串流"

msgid "{host}: {reason} – connecting again in {s} s"
msgstr "{host}：{reason} – {s} 秒後重新連線"

msgid "{host}: connected again"
msgstr "{host}：已重新連線"

msgid "could not open the stream"
msgstr "無法開啟串流"

msgid "{name}: playing the stream directly, without timeshift ({reason})"
msgstr "{name}：直接播放串流，不使用時光平移（{reason}）"

msgid "Connection lost ({reason}) – connecting again in {s} s"
msgstr "連線中斷（{reason}）– {s} 秒後重新連線"

msgid "Connected again"
msgstr "已重新連線"

msgid "{name} has no catch-up"
msgstr "{name} 沒有回看功能"

msgid "Catch-up: {title} ({name}, {time})"
msgstr "回看：{title}（{name}，{time}）"

msgid "Timeshift for internet channels"
msgstr "網路頻道的時光平移"

msgid "Internet TV channels go through the timeshift buffer like a tuner's: pause, jump back and keep the buffer as a recording. Radio streams play directly."
msgstr "網路電視頻道像調諧器頻道一樣經過時光平移緩衝區：可暫停、倒轉並將緩衝區保留為錄影。廣播串流直接播放。"

msgid "Quality of HLS / DASH streams"
msgstr "HLS / DASH 串流品質"

msgid "Automatic (follows the connection)"
msgstr "自動（依連線狀況）"

msgid "Always the best"
msgstr "永遠最佳"

msgid "Automatic switches to a lower quality when the connection gets slow; the buffer keeps what arrived. Always the best looks the same all the time, but stops to wait on a slow connection."
msgstr "連線變慢時，自動模式會切換到較低畫質；緩衝區會保留已收到的內容。「永遠最佳」畫質始終一致，但在連線緩慢時會停下來等待。"

msgid "Reconnect internet streams"
msgstr "重新連線網路串流"

msgid "When the connection of an internet or Tvheadend channel breaks, it is opened again after a few seconds, for up to three minutes."
msgstr "網路或 Tvheadend 頻道的連線中斷時，會在幾秒後重新開啟，最長持續三分鐘。"

msgid "Watch from the Start"
msgstr "從頭觀看"

msgid "Plays the programme from its start from the provider's archive (catch-up)"
msgstr "從供應商的存檔中從頭播放節目（回看）"

msgid "HLS and DASH internet streams are recorded with one audio track (the preferred language when it is offered)."
msgstr "HLS 和 DASH 網路串流以一條音軌錄製（若有提供，則為偏好語言）。"

msgid "margin"
msgstr "餘量"

msgid "pixel"
msgstr "像素"

msgid "TV"
msgstr "電視"

msgid "Filter"
msgstr "篩選"

msgid "Source or group"
msgstr "來源或群組"

msgid "Favourites list"
msgstr "最愛清單"

msgid "For channels whose type was guessed wrong, e.g. internet streams or imported lists"
msgstr "適用於類型判斷錯誤的頻道，例如網路串流或匯入的清單"

msgid "Sort by number to move channels"
msgstr "請依編號排序以移動頻道"

msgid "Move up in the channel list (Alt+Up)"
msgstr "在頻道清單中上移 (Alt+Up)"

msgid "Move down in the channel list (Alt+Down)"
msgstr "在頻道清單中下移 (Alt+Down)"

msgid "Add to the favourites list"
msgstr "加入最愛清單"

msgid "Remove from the favourites list"
msgstr "從最愛清單移除"

msgid "Move up in the favourites list (Alt+Up)"
msgstr "在最愛清單中上移 (Alt+Up)"

msgid "Move down in the favourites list (Alt+Down)"
msgstr "在最愛清單中下移 (Alt+Down)"

msgid "Empty. Drag channels here or use the arrow button."
msgstr "空白。請將頻道拖曳到此處或使用箭頭按鈕。"

msgid "No favourites list yet. Use the star of a channel to make one."
msgstr "尚無最愛清單。使用頻道的星號即可建立。"

msgid "Sort the channel list"
msgstr "排序頻道清單"

msgid "By group and name"
msgstr "依群組和名稱"

msgid "By the numbers of the DVB-I list"
msgstr "依 DVB-I 清單的編號"

msgid "{n} channels · drag to reorder"
msgstr "{n} 個頻道 · 拖曳以重新排序"

msgid "Shown as the source in the channel list filter. Empty: the name the list gives itself."
msgstr "在頻道清單篩選器中顯示為來源。空白：清單本身的名稱。"

msgid "The name the list gives itself"
msgstr "清單本身的名稱"

msgid "Name in the channel list"
msgstr "頻道清單中的名稱"
